<title>USA: Vacation Break sees Q3 below yr-ago.</title>
<headline>Vacation Break sees Q3 below yr-ago.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vacation Break USA Inc said on Monday its results for this year's third quarter are likely to come in below last year's results for the same period, and may result in a &quot;small loss.&quot;</p>
<p>In the 1995 third quarter, Vacation Break posted net income of $0.19 per share. This year's third quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>The company said the lower projections are the result of fewer vacation arrivals and tours of its resorts, which offer people an ownership interest in resort properties in Florida and the Bahamas.</p>
</text>
